{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>As you vow.</b> Just as I commanded you to be careful in the house of Elohim, likewise in your words, so too you are obligated to be careful in every place and at every time — when you remember HaShem or vow a vow to Him, guard what your lips utter, and do not be among the fools, for He has no desire in them."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:39.508312855Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}